  "thag1.6:0.4": "1. 1. 6. ",
  "thag1.6:1.1": "yo sītavanaṃ upāga bhikkhu ",
  "thag1.6:1.2": "eko santusito samāhitatto ",
  "thag1.6:1.3": "vijitāvī apetalomahaṃso ",
  "thag1.6:1.4": "rakkhaṃ kāyagatāsatiṃ dhitīmā’ti. ",
  "thag1.6:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sītavaniyo thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. sītavaniyattheragāthā. "
}
